{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/790222-gift-for-finding-your-way-in-the-umbra","id":790222,"title":"Gift for finding your way in the umbra.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-21T05:50:54-08:00","id":790222,"title":"Gift for finding your way in the umbra.","content":"i'm wondering if there is a gift similar to what i'm about describe here.<br /> <br /> After learning thit gift a Theurge cannot get lost when in the Umbrae (penumbra or the realms). As long as he has a clear goal or place wants to go he will eventually find his way to it.<br /> A ancestor renowned for tracking or an spirit of a predatory animal teaches this skill.<br /> <br /> If it doesn't already exist what level would be appropriate for a gift with this power?<br /> <br /> Edit: after reading about Airt Sense i think this is very similar to what i want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imageshack.com/i/j5vvlqp\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/j5vvlqp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/ghw20supporterhiddengaroup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">English is not my native language, so i apologize for errors in grammar or spelling.</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/392-cadmiumcadamium","na